  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Inclusion in Peace Process</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective of the project is to increase the participation of women from diverse backgrounds actively involved in the peace process, working towards a just and equitable society in Myanmar.</narrative>
  </description>
